    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Forbes has named Stryker Chairman and CEO, Kevin Lobo, as one of America’s Most Innovative Leaders. Mr. Lobo is listed #33 on the list of 100 most creative and successful founders and CEOs of U.S. firms. Forbes ranked leaders based on criteria and methodology that included media reputation for innovation, social capital, track record and investor expectations for market value creation and innovation.</p>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/lists/innovative-leaders/#60ad63da26aa\">See complete list here</a></span></p>\n",
